            "review_title": "Review at Kuusi By TUNG",
            "review_text": "Alien_Whelk\nWashington DC, District of Columbia28 contributions\n0\nA truly unique cocktail experience!\nJul 2022\nSuper fun night in this recently opened bar that offers a five cocktail tasting menu done in an omakase style where you just get what they give you. Sounds a bit risky but the cocktails were spectacular, each one very different to the last but all perfectly balanced and utterly delicious. Drinks are by ‘The Mood Therapist’ and use modern sciences techniques like vacuum distillation and centrifuges and they did a good job explaining how everything came to me. There was one mad drink that was pink and sparkling but tasted deeply of rich chocolate. How the hell do they do that??we did the food pairing as well so each drink comes with a small snack that pairs perfectly with the food and enhances the flavours. The prawn with chorizo oil paired with a rum, pear and onion (yes - onion!) was incredible - the food really enhanced the flavour of the drink when you go back in for another sip. Snacks not enough for dinner, just enough to stop you falling off your chair after five drinks!\n\nCan’t recommend this place enough. I can see it getting crazy busy so glad to get in early.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 9, 2022\nCRM at Kuusi by TUNG\nDear Mr/Ms. Alien_Whelk,\n\nThank you for taking the time to enjoy and then recommend Kuusi by TUNG to the Tripadvisor community. We are glad that you had a fun and memorable evening enjoying Cocktails at Kuusi. Your review will promote the ability to work and constantly innovate of the staff. Kuusi hopes to have the opportunity to welcome you back in the near future.\n\nWarmes regards,\nRead more\nWritten July 10, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
