            "review_text": "SaigonStevo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam429 contributions\n0\nRock Star Cocktail Bar\nJun 2022 • Couples\nMr. McDonough and Mr. Tung have made the ultimate, intimate Rock Star cocktail bar experience. Right underneath one of the best restaurants in Asia (TUNG dining). Not to be missed!!!\nWritten June 30, 2022\nCRM at Kuusi by TUNG\nDear SaigonStevo,\n\nThank you for taking the time to write a review for Kuusi by TUNG. We are delighted to know that you had a good experience at Kuusi. Your positive feedback helps Kuusi's team to grow and improve in Cocktails and services.\nWe thank you again for your ongoing support and look forward to welcoming you back for another time.\n\nWarmest regards,\nRead more\nWritten July 2, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
