            "review_text": "Thao Anh Nguyen\nHanoi, Vietnam37 contributions\n0\nA lovely night at Kuusi by TUNG!\nMay 2022\nI went to Kuusi by TUNG because I was curious about its new concept - the first place in Vietnam to serve cocktails tasting menu with the definition of a “emotional charging station”. When experiencing the set menu with 5 cocktails, I was so impressed with not only the taste and the presentation, but also the way to make them. One more pros is that the space at Kuusi is very cozy with deep wood tones. This was a great experience, I will definitely come back next time.\nRead more\nWritten June 25, 2022\nCRM at Kuusi by TUNG\nDear Ms. Thaoanhh96,\n\nThank you very much for taking the time to note down a review for Kuusi by TUNG. We are so excited to know that you had a good experience at Kuusi. Your valuable feedback helps Kuusi's team to grow and improve in Cocktails and services. We thank you again for your ongoing support and look forward to welcoming you back for another time.\n\nBest regards,\nRead more\nWritten July 2, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
