            "review_text": "Sandhya K\n4 contributions\n1\nDelectable, creative cocktails!!\nMay 2022\nI just spent a delightful evening at Kuusi by Tung, the new bar next door to Tung Dining, which offers a cocktail tasting menu, which can be accompanied by a small bite food pairing. The flight of five cocktails designed and executed by chief intoxicologist Richard McDonough captures your imagination and caters to all your senses. The first drink, the Mortlach High Ball… was literally a ball sitting in your glass. You are instructed to tip it into your mouth, where it pops like a bubble, releasing the perfectly chilled whiskey concoction down your throat. The second drink, 66% More Bubbles, was simply magical. It was a gorgeous rhubarb color and tasted like pink champagne, but had an intoxicating aroma and after taste of cacao! What sounded like a bizarre combination of flavors really came together perfectly to make you take sip after sip. The rest of the cocktails, all equally interestingly named and flavored, were also delightful. By the end of the ‘flight’, my mood was perfectly elevated, though I was grateful that I had eaten dinner before coming, and that we had chosen to do the food pairing. The little bites (which were brought fresh from Tung Dining next door) were delectable and went perfectly with the drinks. We ended up lingering to order ‘just one more’ drink off the a-la-carte menu. Definitely a must-try for cocktail lovers in Hanoi. There are limited seats so make sure you reserve a time slot!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 30, 2022\nCRM at Kuusi by TUNG\nDear Ms. Sandy2258, \n\nThank you for taking the time to write a review for Kuusi by TUNG. We are delighted to know that you had a good experience at Kuusi. Your positive feedback helps Kuusi's team to grow and improve in Cocktails and services. \nWe thank you again for your ongoing support and look forward to welcoming you back for another time. \n\nBest regards,\nRead more\nWritten June 25, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
